  "reason": "Accept non-Latin-1 selector, property and keyframe names and custom property references. Seven patch corpus trees and eighteen of their seeded edits exercise the repaired names. Edit 011-e1 duplicates a ZWNJ-started segment immediately after a block, so the recovery tree changes and the descendant error remains. Every previously error-free tree in this comparison is unchanged.",
